          "text": "开发者认证"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "•",
            "listType": "bullet",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "开放平台地址："
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "{origin}/info/custom_openapi/openapi/backend/home",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "{origin}/info/custom_openapi/openapi/backend/home",
                        "title": null
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\t"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "注：如提示登录就去登录，需要后台管理员账号，地址为：e10系统 -> 后台管理中心 -> 开放平台 -> 开发者认证栏目",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong",
                      "attrs": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "使用本系统的系统管理员账号登录开放平台。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "•",
            "listType": "bullet",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "登录开放平台之后"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ordered_list",
      "attrs": {
        "order": 1,
        "spread": "false"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "1.",
            "listType": "ordered",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "确认登录的团队是否是需要对接的团队。若发现不是需要对接的团队，可点击【切换】切换团队。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672808238940160.0.png",
                    "alt": "",
                    "title": ""
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "2.",
            "listType": "ordered",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "可以看到登录之后是未认证的状态，只有通过认证之后，才能对接。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672808238940160.1.png",
                    "alt": ""
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "3.",
            "listType": "ordered",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "点【编辑】进行开发者认证。完善信息之后点击保存信息即可完成认证。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "认证信息可要求确保真实有效，也可无需那么精确，看项目要求。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "4.",
            "listType": "ordered",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "认证之后，开发者资料后的状态会变为已认证。认证之后会显示Corpid，后续调用接口会用到。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672808238940160.2.png",
                    "alt": ""
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
